ng him  Bill ignores the strange occurrence and  sits down to listen to the cockpit  recordings a while later Luis finally  brings him and the others their coffee  the two seem attracted to each other and  after she leaves bill notices something  odd while listening to the audio he  hears the first officer yell that the  passengers had already died and were  burned before the plane crashed however  the investigation shows no evidence of a  fire before the crash this confuses all  of the investigators and they conclude  that the first officer might have said  that out of fear and shock after this  bill enters the gymnasium where the dead  bodies and their personal belongings are  being examined the lead examiner shows  Bill a digital watch that somehow is  moving backward in time in addition The  Examiner brings out two other watches  also moving backward further adding to  the confusion because all three of them  couldn't be broken at the same time  later bill is seen answering questions  from reporters in a press conference Dr  Arnold also shows up and pressures him  by asking if the team has found any  unusual phenomena from the crash site  however bill doesn't answer the question  and says that it is confidential  information after the press conference  he decides to go to his hotel and on the  way he bumps into Louise Bill invites  her for a cup of coffee but she proposes  they go out for dinner her instead I  guess they skipped a few more steps  because the scene then cuts to the two  in bed after Belle falls asleep Louise  sneaks into the bathroom then she calls  the room service to cancel Bill's 6 30  a.m wake up the next day the next  morning Bill is frustrated as the hotel  didn't wake him up Louise says that this  might be fate and for some reason tries  to convince him to not go to work  however bill says the investigation is  very urgent he then leaves the room only  to return back in a few minutes after  remembering he left something behind but  to his 