ixed everything as the  team of time traveling women returns we  are introduced to Louise's personal  robot Sherman he tells her that their  Master is calling them so they go into  the control room to meet him their  Master then tells Louise that because  she talked to Bill it has caused the  past to change and this causes a Time  Quake similar to an earthquake Furious  Louise questions her master if she  should have killed Bill however she is  soon told by another one of her  teammates that it would have resulted in  a major time Paradox killing everyone  and giving Tarantino really good ideas  this calms Louise down and shortly after  they watch bill on a screen as he wakes  up when he starts yelling her name  Louise is stunned as she believes she  had just met bill for the first time she  asks Sherman how he could have known her  name the latter explains that in Bill's  timeline however in Louise's timeline  she met him for the first time in the  hangar where she went to retrieve the  stunner afterwards Sherman puts Louise  through a set of tests and scans her  body for another mission to 1963. he  then states that Louise didn't have  enough cigarettes back in 1969. this  indicates that the air in the future has  become so polluted that whenever they  travel back in the past they smoke  cigarettes to mimic their own timeline's  atmosphere Sherman then preps her for  time travel and makes her dress up as an  air hostess following this we are shown  a lecture by Dr Arnold Mayer where he  discusses the possibility of visits from  Time Travelers he goes on to explain  that time travelers prefer not to be  seen by people or they only come into  contact with people who are likely to  never be seen by others again like on a  plane when its crash is inevitable he  ends his lecture by claiming that time  travelers are real we just have less  information about them this better be a  community college elsewhere Louise and  the others leap into the time machine  and travel back to 1963 where they  appear on a plane they use the stunners  to slowly take out the other air hostess  and the passengers as they do so a man  attempts to hijack the plane which  results in a time traveler getting shot  this causes her to drop her stunner  which is found by a boy Louise then uses  her stunner to kill the man after a  while the boy tries to inform her about  the previous stunner he found but Louise  puts him to sleep before he can say  anything afterward the entire back half  of the plane goes through the time  machine into the future it turns out  that the plane in 1963 was going to  crash so teams from the future are sent  into the past to abduct people who will  die from the impact this way no lives  are taken since the people who were  about to die in the plane crash are the  ones being taken to the Future the team  then escorts the passengers out of the  plane and replaces them with identical  clones who are already dead this  explains the first officer's comment on  the bodies being burned before the crash  as the time travelers had pre-burned the  identical clones in preparation for the  crash if you predicted that plot twist  we here at mystery recap owe you a  cookie after that the master discloses  that the man who is about to hijack the  plane was going to shoot toward the  cockpit resulting in a crash hence he  orders the ladies to plant a bomb in the  cockpit so as not to alter the past  which will also prevent any paradoxes  after placing the bomb inside the  cockpit the team then gets off the plane  afterward the wounded time traveler says  that she lost her stunner in the plane  so Louise decides to rush back to the  plane and find it however the bomb in  the cockpit has already started counting  down forcing her to get off in the next  scene we see Louise in a council meeting  with people inside large tubes which  helps them survive due to the harsh  conditions of the future the council  says that the first stunner which she  lost in 1969 ended up in the possession  of Bill Smith and the second one which  she lost in 1963 will eventually end up  in the hands of Dr Arnold Mayer if he  finds out what it can do he might be  capable of figuring out how it works and  might unveil The Truth About Time  Travelers so they decide to risk another  mission back to 19 69 where she will  meet Bill a day before he got the  stunner and prevent him from finding it  in the hangar the scene then cuts into  the past where Bill sees Louise for the  first time while he asks her for a cup  of coffee the movie plays out as it did  before and this explains why she was  trying to convince Bill to not go to  work previously before they go to the  hotel Louise does a bunch of normal  activities very weirdly like driving a  car and eating a salad as in her  timeline these things are not possible  the next day after Bill leaves the room  for work Louise calls to be returned  back to the future and as a result Bill  cannot find her in the room when she  returns shortly after she returns they  experience another time Quake but this  one is much more intense afterward  Louise and the master observe Bill and  realize that instead of investigating  the crash he is searching for Louise and  the answers behind his unusual  experience in the hangar Louise then  says that bill will most probably meet  with Dr Arnold Mayer and discuss her and  the stunner Bill eventually visits  Arnold and it is revealed that the  stunner lost in 1963 wound up in  Arnold's possession which set his path  to investigate what caused the crash  Arnold then shows the stunner to him  while Bill also shows the part of the  stunner that he found in the hangar  unbeknownst to both of them bill is  actually in the possession of the  stunner initiator it is then revealed  that bill was also one of the passengers  who boarded the 1963 plane and was the  only one to survive in fact he is the  same boy that saw the stunner and was  put to sleep by Louise before he could  utter a word meanwhile worried that they  might cause a huge Paradox Louise  decides to pay bill and Dr Arnold a  visit shortly after she materializes  from the future and reveals her mission  to them hoping that the two will  voluntarily keep the secret during the  conversation Arnold accidentally kills  himself while reassembling the stunner  with the help of bill's initiator now  because Arnold was necessary for the  development of the gate technology which  makes time travel possible his death  results in a Time Paradox that will  destroy the entire future civilization  terrified Louise rushes to the time gate  in order to get to the Future however  Bill who has now finally found the love  of his life decides to follow her  through the gate with the intention of  never leaving her side the two jump  through the portal and find that in the  future everything is coming to an end  due to an infinite and intense time  Quake that lasts forever now the only  course of action to save the human race  is to send all the people who were  collected from the planes into the  distant future to repopulate before the  time machine is permanently destroyed so  the master slowly initiates the time  machine after he wakes the people who  were kept unconscious in holding pens he  then orders them to move to the time  portal immediately after everyone is  through the portal Bill prepares to go  through it but stops when Louise says  she has to stay back however Sherman  convinces her to go and start a new life  with Bill it is then revealed that  Louise is pregnant with Bill's child and  so the couple steps through the gate  together and disappears while the  explosions engulf Sherman the master and  all the members of the council let's  hope if they go forward through time  that baby doesn't just explode out of  her tummy  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

